  unitName: Knight Agni
  unitId: 10102
  unitNumber: 123
  description: The imperator of the Agni Imperial Army and brother of the emperor.
    His skill in the literary and military arts and impartial fairness earned him
    the trust of many soldiers. He was even more popular than his brother. However,
    he feared this and hid his face in public with an iron mask to show his loyalty.
    There are still countless more rumors about his face, however.
  summonDesc: A summoner?<br>I will give you my strength,<br>developed in battle.
  fusionDesc: Even Summoners need training!<br>I will not forgive laziness!
